	(text "OUTPUT MUTE & +5V SENSE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 302.26 213.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f03e6b7f-4759-43d9-9e7a-4928f80b6b00")
	)
	(text "R1 (1 MΩ to VREF) sets the guitar load and the DC bias. U1A is a unity-gain buffer: input trim is in firmware.\nR20 limits current into the Daisy pin if U1 is ever overdriven. Passive pickups only: no pad.\nJ1's tip switch shorts the input to GND with no plug in. C1 is an RF shunt. R2 protects U1A's input."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 55.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fd137606-5eb5-42d3-90fd-8858a9622356")
	)
	(text "Passive stereo-to-mono sum\nstraight into AUDIO_IN_2. The Seed3\ninput is AC-coupled (≈ 5 kΩ): no\nbuffer or coupling cap needed.\nR5 sets the level (≤ −8 dB even\nwith no Daisy load) and is the\nsource's DC return.\nC3: RF filter (≈ 110 kHz)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 93.98 81.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5fdec7bb-7eb2-4eab-a939-6ca592e8dfff")
	)
	(text "Q1: reverse-polarity\nprotection for 5V_IN (J6).\nC5 (low-ESR) damps the\nharness ringing. C4 is\nthe entry ceramic."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.6 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8ced076d-2dcb-4abc-b8cc-d98971550a69")
	)
	(text "VREF ≈ 2.5 V, only load R1.\nC7 keeps +5V noise from the\ndisplay out of VREF (≈ 0.7 Hz).\nC6 decouples U1 at pin 5."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 99.06 170.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fe07b91c-fa25-4a5f-88b4-d43b0043c6f9")
	)
	(text "A1 plugs into two 1×20 sockets. Unused pins are no-connect. USB stays on the module."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 144.78 129.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "562b185c-0f50-4716-95f7-9acaccca3ed2")
	)
	(text "R8/R9 limit current if the cable is miswired or hot-plugged. R8 is 10k so the Daisy's TX can't\npower an unpowered display (Daisy on USB): keep the UART at 230400 baud or less.\nFB1/C8 keep the display's current pulses (Wi-Fi, backlight) off +5V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 144.78 187.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7262124e-9131-425d-80a4-42bc45e91a3f")
	)
	(text "Mono to both channels, 16–64 Ω headphones. R10/C9: ≈ 60 kHz low-pass for DAC noise.\nU2: TPA6132A2 DirectPath, −6 dB inverting (G0, G1 low): full scale ≈ 0.40 Vrms, no clipping at 16 Ω.\nOutputs sit at 0 V: no output caps. C10/C11 with U2's 26.4 kΩ inputs: 1.3 Hz high-pass. EN tied to +5V: always on.\nLayout: run SGND straight to the J4 sleeve. HPVDD/HPVSS are made inside U2: caps only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 271.78 91.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9c46d46d-73ed-4716-9a8a-bb6ea0f50faf")
	)
	(text "J4 pins 5–6: isolated N/O switch, closes on plug insertion.\nHP_DETECT is LOW with headphones in. No external pull-up:\nthe firmware enables PA3's internal pull-up.\nBring-up: short TP1 to GND to simulate a plug."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 271.78 135.89 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "946342cf-ec0f-4e04-9aba-c86c15c779c9")
	)
	(text "AUDIO_OUT_2 drives J5 (to the speaker amp)\ndirectly. R11/C16: ≈ 48 kHz low-pass, 1k out. R12: DC return.\nAssumes pin 19 sits at 0 V DC (TEST_PLAN 5.16).\nWith headphones in, the firmware drives SPK_EN low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 271.78 191.77 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2b447b59-2ceb-43d4-991e-bd710ee1cb8f")
	)
	(text "J6 goes to the power board (JST-XH, 8 pins). Pins 5–7 are 3.3 V logic: nothing above 3.3 V on them.\nSPK_MUTE is open drain. The power board pulls it up, so the speaker amp stays muted unless SPK_EN is high.\nR13, R16 and R14 limit current into an unpowered Daisy. R15 holds PWR_HOLD low while the Daisy is absent or booting."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 35.56 264.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3f535bf0-a8d8-42b1-87f6-c218b77ed0c1")
	)
	(text "U2 EN is tied to +5V. A hung Daisy is muted by the\ncodec: the firmware feeds the STM32 IWDG only from the\naudio callback, so if audio stops the STM32 resets, its\nclocks stop and the TAC5242 powers down its DAC.\nR17 holds SPK_EN low (speaker muted) during a reset.\n5V_SENSE ≈ 2.5 V when +5V is up. With +5V off (Daisy on\nUSB) the firmware keeps both outputs silent: U2's inputs\nare rated only to its own rails ± 0.3 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 331.47 219.71 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "30b4cdfa-12e2-4f98-9244-b5001176804e")
	)
