	(text "D1–D5: bidirectional ESD diodes (PESD5V0S1BA: 5 V working,\n35 pF, 5 nA) from every jack signal contact to GND, each placed\nat its jack. Guitar signals stay below the 5 V working voltage.\nThe J2/J4 detect switches are isolated from the plug: no diode."
